___________
MCNPX_2_4_0

RSICC release: MCNPX_2_4_k with proton and photonuclear plotting
and reaction multipliers (D-10:JSH-02-98), corrections, and cleanup.

___________
MCNPX_2_4_k

Preliminary MCNPX_2_4_0 which upgrades MCNPX_2_4_j with
the following new features:
   * Distributed memory multitasking for the entire energy range of
        all particles (GWM);
   * Light ion recoil (JSH) D-10:JSH-02-076;
   * Enhanced color geometry plots (GWM/JSH)  D-10:JSH-02-075;
   * Spontaneous fission (JSH) D-10:JSH-02-072;
   * Photonuclear reaction multipliers (GWM);
   * Corrections,  D-10:JSH-02-076.

___________
MCNPX_2_4_j

Preliminary MCNPX_2_4_0 which combines MCNPX_23002 and
MCNP4C3, adds identifiers/patching capability, and the
following new features:

      * FORTRAN 90 modularity and dynamic memory allocation 
      * Repeated structures source specification improvements
      * Default dose functions: DFn
      * Speedup of slow plot problems
      * Cosine binning of surface flux tallies
      * Specification of cosine binning by degrees
      * Logarithmic interpolation: Nlog
      * Improved test set 
      * Error corrections 

