MCNPX_Dec_01_2001

Possibly a suitable final form for the 2.2.6 release.  Includes
the new Vavilov logic and test problems, Ed Snow's corrections
for the infinite loop problem and for other errors in both the
cylindrical and spherical mesh tallies, Prael's correction for
the frame-of-reference bug in elastic scattering, correction
of a long-standing but newly-discovered bug in the RNOK biasing
of knock-on electrons (and a test problem for that), and the
necessary backing-off of a build system change that caused SGI
systems to fail to load.

